Actually, the standard approach is to check boundaries before each direction:

```zig
while (num <= max) {
    // left to right
    if (top <= bottom) {
        for (left..right+1) |col| {
            rows[top][col] = @intCast(num);
            num += 1;
        }
        top += 1;
